    "message": "A2-DYN author revision: pay physical-boundary atomic derivatives\n\nContinue the complete native triangular Lorentz-gas proof chain with modules 338\u2013342: section-critical fans, endpoint isoroof exclusion, interior-section and unvisited-boundary isoroof payments, and exact raw-resolution transfer.\n\nPreserve the original model, clock, collision records, conditioning, microscopic windows and ordered limits. Retain all 78 predecessor core proofs, all 91 retrieved review-head reports and the native historical archive. Provide a 301-page complete manuscript, point-by-point response, dependency/source/literature audits, 11 exact verification programs and actual three-pass build evidence.\n\nThe full raw pointwise LLT and four-coordinate inversion remain open at the explicitly stated minimum physical closure condition; finite checks and CI are auxiliary evidence only.\n\nAdd only the new A2-DYN revision directory and its isolated workflow. Mathematical-source SHA256: f6ede33cd3f69b9a3256c2a08bd03c84249e2680092957863093223579e38f8e.",
